  "name": "Flash Bang",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A pulse of bright light and energy tears ripples through the air, disrupting creatures caught in the area.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.<br /><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 round.<br /><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TkIyaNPgTZFBCCuh]{Dazzled} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for 1 minute. They may make a Fortitude at the end of each of their turns to end the effect.<br /><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 minute..</p>"
